  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Development in Somalia Phase 2 Multi-Donor Trust Fund  (No. TF074055)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The IFC Private Sector Development in Somalia (PSDS) Trust Fund will help catalyze private investment and contribute to job creation and revenue mobilization. The Trust Fund will do this by (a) strengthening the voice and capacity of the private sector in engaging with the government to improve the business environment, (b) enhancing technical expertise and capacity of business-facing public institutions in formulation and enforcement of economic laws, rules and regulations, and (c) building capacity of businesses in selected sectors in design and delivery of financial and non-financial services in support of enterprise development. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
